WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.330
Shipping through Öresund. The showcase examines the waters between Helsingborg and Helsingør.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:16.130
YOLO and AI2 produce different detections. Their counts are not an accuracy comparison.

00:00:17.250 --> 00:00:23.490
Repeated observations highlight areas of activity in the sampled satellite passes.

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:31.330
Vessel types, speeds and headings are model predictions that need independent checks.
